","src":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/n4hkNeBJoO0","alt":"Mime demonstration video 2","caption":"Mime demonstration · Video 02"},{"id":"mime-access-screen","src":"data:image/png;base64,","alt":"Mime V1.1 joint control access screen","caption":"Mime V1.1 · Joint control access screen."},{"id":"mime-control-menu","src":"data:image/png;base64,","alt":"Mime control menu with output mode, input source, calibration, and toggles","caption":"Control menu · Output mode, input source, calibration, and toggles."},{"id":"mime-open-hand","src":"data:image/png;base64,","alt":"Mime camera tracking an open hand with finger landmarks and control indicators","caption":"Computer-vision input · Open hand, finger landmarks, and live control indicators."},{"id":"mime-closed-hand","src":"data:image/png;base64,","alt":"Mime camera tracking a closed hand in four-position output mode","caption":"Computer-vision input · Closed hand in 4POS output mode."}],"homeFeatureRank":1},{"title":"Autonomous Color-Following Robot with RC Mode","status":"Completed · Iterated","section":"Robotics & Mechatronics","summary":"Designed and 3D printed a custom educational robot chassis, then integrated vision, distance sensing, embedded control, LCD feedback, autonomous following, and hotspot-based remote control.","details":["Combined Arduino Uno, ESP32, Pixy2 vision, ultrasonic sensing, wiring, and embedded programming.","Developed as a K–12 engineering experience demonstrating circuitry, sensors, programming, robotics, and fabrication."],"methods":["SolidWorks","Arduino Uno","ESP32","Pixy2","FDM 3D printing"],"featured":false,"gallery":[{"src":"data:image/webp;base64,","alt":"Bull's Ice Cream autonomous and remote-control educational robot","caption":"Completed educational robot with custom printed chassis, Pixy2 sensing, LCD feedback, and embedded controls."},{"src":"data:image/webp;base64,","alt":"Mobile web controller for the Bull's Ice Cream robot","caption":"ESP32-hosted control interface with RC and 